Happy 1st Anniversary

One year ago, two hearts found each other and began writing a story that feels like it was always meant to be. In the span of twelve months, we’ve turned ordinary days into memories that glow, and we’ve turned challenges into reasons to hold on tighter. With you, even silence feels like a language, and every glance feels like a promise.

I pray that time will always be kind to us. May our love never fade, but instead grow deeper, softer, and stronger with each passing year. May we have the patience to weather storms and the wisdom to cherish calm skies. And may we never forget that love is not just about the grand gestures, but about showing up for each other every single day.

My wish is that our journey will last a lifetime, filled with laughter that echoes in our home, warmth that carries us through the hardest nights, and faith that we are always better together. May this be only the first chapter of a love that has no end.

Happy Anniversary, my dearest. To us, to our forever, and to the countless tomorrows we will share. 🌹
